==Icelandic==

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|tilkynnti|tilkynnt}}

# {{lb|is|transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[announce]] something to someone, to [[make known|make]] something [[make known|known]] to someone, to [[notify]] someone of something
# {{lb|is|transitive|governs the dative}} to [[announce]] to someone, to [[make known]] to someone, to [[notify]] someone
# {{lb|is|ditransitive|governs the dative and accusative}} to [[inform]] somebody of something, to [[announce]] something to someone, to [[make known|make]] something [[make known|known]] to someone, to [[notify]] someone of something

